== PM spellings
  pee em  | It is 11.04 p.m. in Tokyo. | Alarm set for 7 p.m. tomorrow.
  P M     | It is 11.04pm in Tokyo. | Alarm set for 7pm tomorrow.
  p m     | It is 11.04pm in Tokyo. | Alarm set for 7pm tomorrow.

== billions (want 1.4 billion = 1,400,000,000)
  one billion four hundred million   | The population is 1,400,000,000,000 people.
  one point four billion             | The population is 1.4 billion people.
  1.4 billion digits                 | The population is 1.4 billion people.
  seven point nine billion           | The world has 7.9 billion people.
  three hundred forty million        | The country has 340 million people.

